      },
      "lineNbr": 451,
      "author": {
        "id": 1951687
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-30T15:29:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That wouldn\u0027t be enough. The folder would be present for any CONFIG_KVM\u003dy kernel.\n\nWe could look for one of the \"protected_hyp_mem\" files... but then it means we could silently fail in case of a problem instead of catching something is wrong with that kernel?",
      "parentUuid": "741f8c97_f8111514",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 451,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 451,
        "endChar": 24
      },
